        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Wenling, Xinzheng, Wuyantou, Zhejiang, Henan, China\n- Systems: Jiangxia Tidal Power Station\n- Organizations: Taizhou, Zhengzhou\n\nFacts:\n- Wenling is a coastal county-level city in the municipal region of Taizhou in southeastern Zhejiang province, China.\n- Xinzheng is a small county-level city of Zhengzhou in the southern part of Henan province in Central China.\n- The Jiangxia Tidal Power Station is located in Wuyantou, Wenling City, Zhejiang Province, China.\n- The Jiangxia Tidal Power Station is the fourth largest tidal power station in the world.",
